4.63],[1756684800,42.94],[1759276800,14.41],[1761955200,30.34],[1764547200,34.94],[1767225600,40.07],[1769904000,30.69],[1772323200,24.03],[1775001600,27.08],[1777593600,19.07],[1780272000,11.79],[1782864000,18.5],[1785542400,8.27],[1788220800,-15.46]]}]}],"qna":[{"question":"What is the significance of Domestic Tractor Sales data?","answer":"Tractor sales can be a barometer of the economic health of the agriculture sector, farmers' income levels, and their capacity to invest in farm equipment.^This data helps in understanding the investment trends in the agricultural sector, particularly in terms of capital goods and investment in agricultural machinery.^Increased level of mechanisation can be a predictor of future increases in agricultural output due to improved cultivation practices.^The data can be used to assess the impact of government policies aimed at supporting farmers, such as subsidies for agricultural machinery or credit availability.^Sales data also reflects the impact of external factors such as government policies such as subsidies, credit availability, and fuel prices."},{"question":"How to interpret the Domestic Tractor Sales data?","answer":"Rising sales suggest rising disposable income in the medium and large farmers category and their ability to invest in machinery.^High tractor sales typically indicate a move towards increased mechanisation in agriculture, which can lead to higher productivity and efficiency in farming operations. While decreases could signal economic challenges, lower agriculture productivity or saturation in the market."},{"question":"What does the Domestic Tractor Sales data represent?","answer":"This data represents the number of tractors sold in the domestic market over a specified period.^Tractor sales reveal rural demand, which is largely associated with agricultural income levels. Rising incomes often lead to increased sales."}],"related":[{"slug":"average-daily-electronic-toll-collection","title":"E-Toll Collections (Daily Avg)"},{"slug":"bank-credit-growth","title":"Bank Credit Growth"},{"slug":"capacity-utilisation","title":"Capacity Utilisation"},{"slug":"cement-production","title":"Cement Production"},{"slug":"crude-oil-price-indian-basket","title":"Crude Oil Price (Indian Basket)"},{"slug":"domestic-passenger-car-sales","title":"Domestic Passenger Car Sales"},{"slug":"energy-requirements","title":"Energy Requirements"},{"slug":"essential-commodity-prices","title":"Essential Commodity Prices"},{"slug":"goods-and-services-tax-gst-collections","title":"GST Collections"},{"slug":"money-supply-m3","title":"Money Supply (M3)"},{"slug":"natural-gas-production","title":"Natural Gas Production"},{"slug":"non-oil-exports","title":"Non-Oil Exports"},{"slug":"petroleum-consumption","title":"Petroleum Consumption"},{"slug":"private-consumption-pfce","title":"Private Consumption (PFCE)"},{"slug":"revenue-earnings-railway-freight-traffic-major-commodities","title":"Railway Freight Traffic- Revenue"},{"slug":"steel-consumption","title":"Steel Consumption"},{"slug":"steel-production","title":"Steel Production"},{"slug":"two-wheeler-sales","title":"Domestic Two-Wheeler Sales"}],"title":"Domestic Tractor Sales","description":"India's domestic tractor sales stand at 130.6 Thousand for Sep 2026. Tractor demand tracks farm income and monsoon outcomes closely.","headline":{"Absolute":"India's domestic tractor sales stand at 130.6 Thousand for Sep 2026. Tractor demand tracks farm income and monsoon outcomes closely.","Y-o-Y":"India's domestic tractor sales stand at -15.46% for Sep 2026. Tractor demand tracks farm income and monsoon outcomes closely."},"source":"CMIE Economic Outlook, 1 Finance Research","source_url":"https://economicoutlook.cmie.com/","date_modified":"2026-09-01","scraped_at":"2026-10-14T12:00:51+00:00"}